# 🤖 CARLOS

> CARLOS — Cost-efficient, Available, Replicated, Lightweight, Open, Secure — is an application architecture: one static Go binary per app, one fully-isolated instance per account, many instances on one small box. This site documents the architecture, the platform that runs it, and the carlos CLI.

Every docs page below is served as plain markdown at the listed URL; the same page rendered for people is the URL without the `.md`.
